# NOTE: .github/ must NOT be ignored. It holds the CI and deploy workflows,
# and GitHub only runs workflows that exist in the repository. Ignoring it
# does not untrack the four existing files, but any workflow added or renamed
# afterwards is silently excluded and never runs.

